  "articleBody": "Replacing kitchen countertops is easiest to price and schedule when the provider confirms the existing measurements, sink and cooktop cutouts, cabinet condition, edge profile, backsplash, disposal plan, and any plumbing or electrical changes before ordering material. In San Diego County, also ask whether the planned scope requires city review or permits, especially when the layout or connected systems change.",
